XCOMM The MNT VA2000 card for the X11R6.3 RTG layer (hw/amix/rtg/rtg.h).
XCOMM Copied into programs/Xserver/hw/amix/rtg/va2000 by the x11r6.3 package
XCOMM build; rtg/Imakefile lists it in SUBDIRS and adds -DRTG_VA2000 to
XCOMM RTGCARDS, and the server links LibraryTargetName(va2000) (README.md).
XCOMM -DVA2000_STATS builds the blitter counters and the slow-wait log.

#include <Server.tmpl>

SRCS = va2000hw.c va2000blit.c

OBJS = va2000hw.o va2000blit.o

STD_DEFINES = ServerDefines -DRTG -DRTG_VA2000
   INCLUDES = -I. -I.. -I../.. -I../../../../include -I$(XINCLUDESRC) -I$(FONTINCSRC)

NormalLibraryObjectRule()
NormalLibraryTarget(va2000, $(OBJS))

DependTarget()
